       "text": "Fixed a visual issue with the victory scene at Portland International Raceway.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue that may have caused a longer load time on initial game boot up.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
